CCAAVVEEAATTSS
       Because  the  values  of  _t_z_n_a_m_e,  _t_i_m_e_z_o_n_e,  and  _d_a_y_l_i_g_h_t  are  often
       unspecified,  and  accessing  them  can  lead  to undefined behavior in
       multithreaded applications, code should instead obtain time zone offset
       and abbreviations from the _t_m___g_m_t_o_f_f and _t_m___z_o_n_e members of the broken‐
       down time structure ttmm(3type).

BBUUGGSS
       Since this function does not report errors, there’s no way to  know  if
       the value of TZ represents a valid time zone.

